<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">21. INDEPENDENT CONTRACTOR. The parties understand,
acknowledge and agree that the Independent Director&rsquo;s relationship with the Company is that of an independent contractor and nothing
